# {{.GameName}}

A standalone single-player game built on the Ironwail-Go engine
(github.com/darkliquid/ironwail-go/sdk).

## Commands

```sh
go mod tidy        # resolve quake + engine module replaces
go test ./...      # run the sim tests (qcmod test also works)
make build         # build the game binary
make run           # build + run (from the parent dir, where ./<modname> is
                   # found; game data is loaded from ./<modname>)
```

## Gameplay stubs

`progs/progs.go` contains `SpawnPlayerStart` and `HealthPickupThink` stubs
following `pkg/qgo/quakego` patterns. Port your QuakeC/QuakeGo logic there,
or copy the full gameplay base and adapt it.